# Test and lint tools of the CI (scripts/lock.sh locks them into requirements-dev.txt, with hashes,
# constrained to the runtime versions of requirements.txt). pip-audit checks requirements.txt for
# known vulnerabilities. playwright + axe-playwright-python: the browser checks of the UI (test_ui_browser).
pytest
pytest-cov
respx
ruff
mypy
pip-audit
playwright
axe-playwright-python
# cyclonedx-bom: the release's SBOM of requirements.txt (cyclonedx-py, release.yml).
cyclonedx-bom
# sigstore: the tests of the release verifier (src/brokersync/provenance.py).
-r requirements-verify.in
